@startuml 有状态崩溃恢复(stdio 子进程)
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowparam false
skinparam shadow false
skinparam defaultFontName "Segoe UI"
skinparam ArrowColor #5A5A5A
skinparam ArrowFontColor #333333
skinparam ArrowFontSize 11
skinparam SequenceParticipantBorderColor #7A93BE
skinparam SequenceParticipantBackgroundColor #DCE9FB
skinparam SequenceParticipantFontColor #1F2933
skinparam SequenceLifeLineBorderColor #7A93BE
skinparam SequenceGroupBackgroundColor #F7F9FC
skinparam SequenceGroupBorderColor #7A93BE
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FFFBE6
skinparam NoteBorderColor #E0B400
skinparam NoteFontColor #5C4A00

title 有状态崩溃:会话随进程死亡,需完整握手恢复

participant "Claude Code\n(Host)" as CC
participant "MCP Server\n(stdio 子进程)" as S

== 正常会话(已建立) ==
CC -> S  : initialize → initialized\n(握手完成,session abc123)
S -> CC  : tools/list → [tools...]\n(会话内上下文已累积)

== 💥 工具执行中崩溃 ==
CC -> S  : tools/call "build_project"
note right of S : Server 执行中...
S -> CC : ~~(无响应)~~ 💥 进程崩溃\nstdio 管道 EOF 断开
note right of CC #FFD6D6
  <b>会话灾难</b>
  session abc123 随进程消失
  内存里的能力协商、
  订阅状态、会话上下文
  <b>全部丢失</b>
end note

== 被迫完整恢复(~4 步往返) ==
CC -> S  : ⑧ 重新 spawn 子进程
CC -> S  : ⑨ initialize(重新握手)
S -> CC  : result + Mcp-Session-Id: def456
CC -> S  : ⑩ initialized
CC -> S  : ⑪ tools/list(可能要重新拿)
S -> CC  : [tools...]
CC -> S  : ⑫ tools/call "build_project"(终于能重试)
S -> CC  : result

@enduml
